# Silverpine Forest (13-15): the Forsaken's Sepulcher and the forest around it (Erland's escort, the
# Yorick brothers at the Ivar Patch, the Dead Fields, the Skittering Dark, Dalar Dawnweaver's study
# of Arugal's worgen up to Pyrewood Village and the Greymane Wall, the Dalaran wizards of Ambermill,
# the Decrepit Ferry), with the trip to Undercity and Brill these quests send you on, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/silverpine_forest_13_15.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites, race and class masks, drops and the
# places of mobs and objects from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games
# (Silverpine Forest, area 130; Tirisfal Glades; Undercity); Zygor's route as a check (there is no
# RestedXP route below level 21). Wowhead refused the requests (403, three in a row, 12 minutes
# apart), so its comments were not read: the research is partial.
# The quest list is section 4 of addon/guides/horde_1_40_allocation.md.
# Data correction: Wild Hearts (429) needs Lost Deathstalkers (428) handed in first (outof.games:
#   "Finish first"); the data only calls 428 its breadcrumb, so its accept says `after 428`.
#
# Starts at the zeppelin tower outside Undercity, in Tirisfal Glades, where the zeppelins from
#   Orgrimmar land: the Undead, Tauren and Orc & Troll starters (and the Horde Skyborne) should end
#   there. From the tower the guide walks to Brill, then into Undercity for its bat master, then down
#   the road into Silverpine Forest.
# Carried in (skipped by those who lack it):
# - for Windshaper Skyborne druids, Moonglade (94913, Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff): whatever
#   leads the Horde Skyborne from Mulgore (where the Skyborne Starter's skycutter lands them) to
#   Undercity should take it in Thunder Bluff. Teleport: Moonglade hands it in from anywhere: here
#   just before a hearthstone.
# Left to The Barrens & Stonetalon Mountain (15-21):
# - Sample for Helbrim (1358, Apothecary Zinge in Undercity, after Zinge's Delivery 1359): handed in
#   to Apothecary Helbrim at the Crossroads.
# Dropped (candidates for a later Silverpine guide, around level 18):
# - Rot Hide Ichor (443), Rot Hide Origins (444), Thule Ravenclaw (446), Report to Hadrec (448): the
#   ichor drops from the rot hide gnolls of Fenris Keep and the isle, levels 16-19 (a level 22 elite
#   Bruiser among them), too high for a duo of 14-15; the rest of the chain only follows it.
# - Resting in Pieces (460), The Hidden Niche (461), Wand to Bethor (491): Alaric's head drops from
#   those same rot hides, and his grave and the hidden alcove are inside Fenris Keep, among them.
# - A Recipe For Death (451, the third): the moss comes from the Lake Creepers and Skulkers of
#   Lake Lordamere's islands, levels 15-19, and the Hardened Tumor drops one time in twenty.
# - Threat from Below (99051, Orgnil Soulscar in Razor Hill): taken, done (the Spitelash naga of
#   Durotar's coast) and handed in in Durotar, which this guide never visits; its follow-up (99052)
#   is the Orc & Troll Starter's, so that starter should do both.
# Race-only quests: Supplying the Sepulcher and its bat errand (6321-6324) are for the Undead only
#   (the builder keeps them for Undead characters). The Deathstalkers (1886, 1898, 1899, 1978) are
#   for Undead rogues, after Mennet Carkad (1885) in the Undead Starter, and Moonglade (94913) for
#   Windshaper druids: the builder's `only` knows classes, not races, so the tips say who.
# The auction house: Murloc Eyes (Wild Eyes, 91920) are sold cheaply in Undercity: the guide offers
#   them at the first Undercity visit. Every other quest item here is bound to the quest.
#
# The route: the zeppelin tower, Brill and Undercity; the road south to Erland and the Ivar Patch;
# the Sepulcher (flight path, hearthstone) and the Moonrage Whitescalps below it; a loop north (the
# wheat farm's spellbooks, the Dead Fields and Nightlash, the Skittering Dark, the Ivar Patch and its
# worgs); a second loop (the Moonrage shackles, Quinn, the murlocs of Lake Lordamere, the Decrepit
# Ferry); a bat to Undercity (Faranell, Zinge, the Undead errands, the rogues' Deathstalkers,
# trainers) and Brill; back by bat, then the Ivar Patch for the last time (Ivar the Foul) and down
# the lake shore to Grimson the Pale and the Dalaran crate; Pyrewood Village (its council, its
# shackles, Berard's journal) and Ambermill; the Greymane Wall's worgen and the hearthstone back;
# the bat to Undercity and the zeppelin tower, where The Barrens & Stonetalon Mountain (15-21)
# starts, in Orgrimmar.

guide Silverpine Forest (13-15)
faction horde
levels 13 15
carry 94913
leave 1358
next The Barrens & Stonetalon Mountain (15-21)

# Tirisfal Glades and Undercity ---------------------------------------------------------------------

map Tirisfal Glades
goto "Start at the zeppelin tower outside Undercity, in Tirisfal Glades" at 60.7,58.9 r 20
accept 445
tip Apothecary Johaan is in the building next to Brill's inn, a short walk north of the tower.
map Undercity
fpath 4551
tip Walk into the ruins south of the tower and take an elevator down. Michael Garrett, the bat master, is in the Trade Quarter. Undead already know him.
ah 91920.1 npc 8672
tip Three Murloc Eyes are cheap here, and they save the murlocs of Lake Lordamere later on.
accept 1886
tip Undead rogues only, after Mennet Carkad (from Marion Call, the rogue trainer in Brill): Mennet is in the Rogues' Quarter. Orc and Troll rogues: right-click the step to skip the quest.

# Erland and the Ivar Patch ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Silverpine Forest
accept 435
tip Leave Undercity and follow the road south-west into Silverpine Forest. Deathstalker Erland waits inside a house north-east of the Ivar Patch, just off the road. If he isn't there, someone else is escorting him: wait for him to come back.
do 435 at 54.4,13.4
tip Both of you take the quest before either starts the escort. He walks to Rane Yorick at the Ivar Patch, and worgs jump him on the way: keep them off him.
do 1886 bg
tip Undead rogues only. Astor Hadren, a messenger, walks the road between the Sepulcher and the north of the forest. Talk to him: he turns hostile, and his letter drops when he dies.
turnin 435
accept 449
tip Wild Hearts, Rane's other quest, opens once Hadrec sends you to him: come back for it later.

# The Sepulcher ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fpath 2226
tip Follow the road south. The Sepulcher is a crypt on the hill west of the road: Karos Razok, the bat master, stands outside.
bind 6739
turnin 449
tip High Executor Hadrec is downstairs in the crypt.
accept 3221 437 428
turnin 3221 445
accept 1359 447
tip Apothecary Renferrel stands outside the crypt. Keep the Wolf Heart Samples for Undercity. Grizzled bears roam all of Silverpine: kill them as you meet them.
accept 421
tip Dalar Dawnweaver walks around outside the crypt.
accept 477
accept 6321
tip Undead only: Deathguard Podrig stands by the crypt.
turnin 6321
accept 6323
tip Undead only. Keep Podrig's Order: you fly to Undercity later.
do 421 at 51.0,40.5
tip The Moonrage Whitescalps roam the slope just east of the Sepulcher, below the road; more wander north along it.
turnin 421
accept 422

# North: the wheat farm, the Dead Fields, the Skittering Dark, the Ivar Patch ---------------------------

do 447.1 bg
tip About every other bear gives a heart. The Giant Grizzled Bears of the north-west hills count too.
do 422
tip The wheat farm is north of the bridge, east of the road. The Dusty Spellbooks lie upstairs in the farmhouse: expect worgen to jump you there.
do 437.2 at 45.9,21.3
do 437.1
tip The rot hide gnolls hold the Dead Fields, west of the road. Kill them until Nightlash, a banshee, appears among them. If her essence drops for only one of you, keep killing gnolls until she comes back.
do 447.2
tip The Skittering Dark is the mine north-west of the Dead Fields: the Moss Stalkers are around and inside it, the Mist Creepers further north.
turnin 428
accept 429 after 428
do 429
tip The Mottled Worgs prowl the fields east of the Ivar Patch, towards Malden's Orchard.

# The Sepulcher ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 422
accept 423
turnin 437
accept 438
turnin 429
accept 430

# North again: the Moonrage, Quinn, the murlocs, the Decrepit Ferry ------------------------------------

do 423.1 at 42.0,29.6
do 423.2 at 43.7,31.2
tip Moonrage Gluttons and Darksouls roam the wooded hills north-west of the Sepulcher, west of the road, and further north-west towards the Dead Fields. A shackle drops about one time in five: it takes a while.
turnin 430
tip Quinn Yorick lies upstairs in the farmhouse of the Ivar Patch.
accept 91920
do 91920 at 59.0,17.5 mobs 1767 1768
tip The Vile Fin Shredders and Tidehunters crowd the north-west shore of Lake Lordamere, east of the Ivar Patch; the Lakestalkers and Oracles further east are level 18-20. Bought the eyes? Then it is already done.
turnin 438
tip The Decrepit Ferry is on the lake shore east of the Sepulcher. Click the Corpse Laden Boat at the landing. The Ravenclaw undead around it are level 14-16: pull them one at a time.
accept 439

# The Sepulcher ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 423
accept 424
turnin 91920
accept 91921
turnin 439
accept 440

# Undercity and Brill ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Undercity, Tirisfal" npc 2226
map Undercity
turnin 6323
tip Undead only: Gordon Wendham sells weapons in the Trade Quarter, where the bat lands.
accept 6322
turnin 6322
accept 6324
tip Undead only. Keep Gordon's Crate for Podrig.
turnin 447
accept 450
tip Master Apothecary Faranell and Apothecary Zinge are in the Apothecarium, in the south-west of the city.
turnin 1359
