tip Varimathras stands beside the Dark Lady in the Royal Quarter.
train 4593 260093 4582 4606 4566 4563
tip Hunters, shamans and druids have no trainer here: train in Orgrimmar, where the next guide starts.
map Tirisfal Glades
turnin 440
tip Leave Undercity by an elevator and walk north past the zeppelin tower to Brill: Magistrate Sevren is in the town hall.
accept 441
map Undercity
turnin 441
tip Raleigh Andrean is in the Trade Quarter.
fly "The Sepulcher, Silverpine Forest" npc 4551
map Silverpine Forest
turnin 6324
tip Undead only.

# The Ivar Patch, Grimson the Pale and the Dalaran crate ----------------------------------------------

turnin 91921
accept 425
do 425
tip Ivar the Foul waits in the barn of the Ivar Patch. Clear the Ravenclaw Slaves around it first, then fight him.
turnin 425
do 424
tip Follow the lake shore south past the Decrepit Ferry: the Deep Elem Mine is in the hills beyond it, among the Moonrage Darksouls. Grimson the Pale is its foreman.
turnin 477
tip The Dalaran wizards keep a small camp by the road north of Pyrewood Village: the crate is there. Their Protectors guard it.
accept 478

