# Pyrewood Village and Ambermill ----------------------------------------------------------------------

accept 452
tip Follow the road south to Pyrewood Village. Deathstalker Faerleia waits in the town hall, in the middle of the village.
do 452
tip The six councilmen of Pyrewood, all level 12-13 elites, come in soon after you accept: fight them beside Faerleia. Only Councilman Smithers' death counts.
turnin 452
do 99
tip Every villager of Pyrewood is a level 13-15 elite, human by day and worgen by night: pull them one at a time. A shackle drops close to every other kill.
do 450
tip Berard's Bookshelf is in his study, in the village inn on the west side of Pyrewood.
do 479
tip From Pyrewood, walk back up the road and take its eastern fork into Ambermill. The Conjurers, at the east end of the village, carry a pendant about every other kill; the Protectors and Mages less often. The Conjurers are level 17-18: pull them one at a time.

# The Sepulcher ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

