# The Greymane Wall ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 98298
tip Follow the road south past Pyrewood towards the Greymane Wall: the Moonrage Bloodhowlers roam the fields on both sides of it.
map Moonglade
turnin 94913
tip Windshaper Skyborne druids only, if Turak Runetotem gave you Moonglade in Thunder Bluff: cast Teleport: Moonglade, hand it in to Dendrite Starblaze, upstairs in her building in Nighthaven, then use your hearthstone with the others.
map Silverpine Forest
hearth npc 6739
turnin 98298

# Undercity and the zeppelin ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Undercity, Tirisfal" npc 2226
map Tirisfal Glades
note "Take the zeppelin from the tower outside Undercity to Orgrimmar, for the next guide" npc 9566
tip Leave Undercity by an elevator: the tower stands a short walk north. Zapetta sends the zeppelin to Orgrimmar.
